# Normalise text to LF in the repository and on checkout, everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# And keep git's hands off the things that are not text. Without this, a clone
# on a machine with core.autocrlf=true -- the Windows default -- rewrites every
# LF inside the corpus PDFs as CRLF. The files still open, which is the
# unpleasant part: pdfplumber reads them, the pipeline runs, the eval prints
# the same scores, and the only visible symptom is that twelve tracked files
# show as modified in a fresh clone that nobody has touched.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
